member.summary:
The report's Markdown.  is the folder the report is written to;
 turns a screenshot path as the UI driver reported it into a full path, so its
image link can be made relative to that folder.

                The diff as text, or empty when nothing changed:


each added subtree in full, one tree line per node, prefixed + ;

each removed subtree's root, prefixed - , with its descendant count;


                        each changed node, prefixed ~ , with its changes as field: from -> to and name and
                        value quoted.


                The first line of each entry ends with its path:.
